{"about_the_game":"Third world dictator + Atlantean technology = big trouble for the rest of the world.  Assume the role of the fictitious, third world dictator, Kimmie Jong On.  While at the beach, he fell into a hole caused by an earthquake.  Here he discovered ancient Atlantean technology: jetpacks, materializers, plasma cannons, and super mega nukes, just to name a few.  Super mega nukes, nukes strong enough to engulf entire countries.  Help Kimmie, in this overhead style shooter, eliminate, one by one,  the nuclear powered countries of the world.  Help our antagonist, in the protagonist role, shoot his way through the Atlantean labyrinths, dungeon like entrapments filled with enemies, puzzles, sub-bosses, and bosses.  Find keys to further your progression past locked doors and avoid wrong turns, traps, and dead ends in the process.  All this, eventually, leading to an epic showdown with Atlantis's ultimate weapon, the Artificial Sentient System, A.S.S.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8b74286f09df0f6e031270a6397c4940e3299fd4.jpg","localized_name":"NO MORE TELEMARKETERS","name":"NO MORE TELEMARKETERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/949090/8b74286f09df0f6e031270a6397c4940e3299fd4.jpg"},{"icon":"2ab6cd959c7484994cf2e0fcfea3af396c567ee9.jpg","localized_name":"BREAKING THE SIXTH SEAL","name":"BREAKING THE SIXTH SEAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/949090/2ab6cd959c7484994cf2e0fcfea3af396c567ee9.jpg"},{"icon":"fd51aff05b625585c9a3de0bfcf5b50d3810f526.jpg","localized_name":"GOD SAVE THE QUEEN","name":"GOD SAVE THE QUEEN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/949090/fd51aff05b625585c9a3de0bfcf5b50d3810f526.jpg"},{"icon":"dcfd3a070c55fdf9ccdd87ce903ed9e6eee0f3ed.jpg","localized_name":"SACRE BLEU!","name":"SACRE BLEU!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/949090/dcfd3a070c55fdf9ccdd87ce903ed9e6e